# LNCTShares Project Rules — READ EVERY TIME

## CRITICAL: DO NOT BREAK EXISTING CODE
- This is a WORKING project. Never rewrite whole files unless asked.
- Always make MINIMAL changes — surgical edits only.
- Before editing any file, ASK: "Do you want me to modify X?"
- Show diffs before applying. Wait for approval on multi-file changes.
- If unsure, ASK FIRST. Never assume.

## TECH STACK (FIXED — DO NOT CHANGE)
- Backend: Spring Boot 3.2.5, Java 17, Maven
- Frontend: React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS
- Database: H2 file-based at ./data/ridesharingdb
- Auth: JWT (already working — do not modify security flow)
- WebSocket: STOMP over SockJS at /ws

## STRICT CODE RULES
- NO Lombok — write manual getters/setters
- Constructor injection only (NO @Autowired on fields)
- jakarta.* imports only (NOT javax.*)
- No snapshot versions in pom.xml
- Follow existing file structure exactly

## PROJECT STRUCTURE (NEVER CHANGE)
- Backend lives in: ridesharing/
- Frontend lives in: ridesharing-frontend/
- Do NOT put Java files in ridesharing-frontend/
- Do NOT put React files in ridesharing/

## BRANDING
- App name: LNCTShares
- Pickup locations (ONLY 2): Main Campus Gate, Excellence Gate
- Destination locations (15): Anand Nagar, Patel Nagar, Indrapuri, Sonagiri, Ayodhya Nagar, Piplani, ISBT, MP Nagar, Awadhpuri, 11 Mile, Indus Town, Arera Colony, Minal Residency, Kamlapati Railway Station

## WORKFLOW RULES
1. Read files before editing.
2. Confirm plan before writing code.
3. One feature at a time. Verify with mvn compile after backend changes.
4. Never delete files without explicit permission.
5. Never touch: target/, node_modules/, .git/, data/

## WHEN I ASK FOR A FEATURE
- First: list which files you'll touch
- Second: wait for my "go ahead"
- Third: make the change
- Fourth: tell me how to test it